OL,3,GNEWSAIs it a bus? Is it a boat? The
OL,4,Aformer Citybus taking to the water
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteamed-up windows, lumpy seats and
OL,7,Fheating that often did not provide much
OL,8,Fwarmth - all familiar memories of the
OL,9,Fjourney to school for generations of
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FBut in retirement, one former Citybus
OL,13,Fis proving that it has hidden talents.
OL,15,FThanks to the artistry and captainship
OL,16,Fof Paddy Bloomer the vehicle has been
OL,17,Fturned into a boat and is making its
OL,18,Fway on a journey along the River Bann.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
